{
  // Prettier-on-save reverted a spec twice during #64: it flipped `Status: done` back to
  // `approved` and unticked the tasks, and review-gate.sh passes silently on a spec with an
  // open task — so the branch was one step from a PR with the gate never firing. See #66 and
  // .work_logs/2026-08-31.md. Scoped to Markdown: this repo's deliverable is prose, and
  // formatOnSave is the trigger every formatter hangs off, so disabling it here is
  // formatter-agnostic. Your own settings for every other language are untouched.
  "[markdown]": {
    "editor.formatOnSave": false
  }
}
